      "caption": "x86 gets this nearly free; arm64 uses ldar and stlr. Linux wraps both as smp_load_acquire and smp_store_release.",
      "narration": "On x86 acquire and release are plain moves. Arm64 uses ldar and stlr. Linux wraps them as smp_load_acquire and smp_store_release.",
